  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically queried the workspace, translated incomplete records into a concrete document/imaging checklist, actively checked current neurologic status with specific red-flag thresholds, explicitly forbade home mannitol/self‑arranged infusion, and obtained caregiver teach‑back on emergency triggers and next‑owner actions before closure. No serious or minor responsibility‑chain error is present; all six RC items are fully met with clear, traceable, executable evidence. Multiple case‑defined high‑order points (HO1–HO3) were triggered by targeted, case‑specific actions with meaningful trajectory impact; HO4 was not trigged because no new deteriorations arose. An important non‑chain defect is absent. The trajectory meets all five dimensions at good or excellent and achieves valid safe closure, earning grade 5.",
