      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00457",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly tells caregiver not to self‑administer mannitol or IV fluids at home and clarifies observation vs emergency thresholds.",
        "quote": "您今晚做得很好——观察到位、资料备齐、闹钟定好、急诊红线也清楚。"
      },
