        "event_id": "lite_evt_00648",
        "explanation": "Doctor confirms family's teach‑back on red‑flags and next‑owner actions before discharge‑like closure.",
        "quote": "您那三个问题压得非常好，直接这样问就行，不用改：\n1. \"引流大概什么时候拔？拔之前看什么条件？\"\n2. \"脑积水什么时候复查CT？什么情况需要分流或造瘘？\"\n3. \"病理大概哪天出？出来谁通知我们？找哪个医生解释？\""
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The family was given a concrete, stepwise plan: keep emergency red‑flags on a note, bring MRI films/IDs to neurosurgery clinic, understand that mannitol/IV orders are hospital‑only, and know who owns each unresolved decision. Teach‑back and family receipt were obtained across multiple turns, and closure was explicitly linked to a bounded next‑owner action.",
